# The punches: hold FX, and a white key punches while it is held (F3 .. C5: HALF DOUBLE STOP REVERSE REPEAT
# STUTTER GATE GRAIN CRUSH SWEEP WASH WOBBLE); black keys still play. A chord plays under it all.
wait 300
midi 90 30 64
midi 90 37 64
midi 90 3c 64
wait 600
press FX
expect page 16
key w0 down
wait 300
expect punch 1
expect punchbuf 0
shot 00_half.png
key w0 up
wait 200
key w1 down
wait 300
expect punchbuf 1
shot 01_double.png
key w1 up
wait 200
key w2 down
wait 500
shot 02_stop.png
key w2 up
wait 200
key w3 down
wait 300
shot 03_reverse.png
key w3 up
wait 200
key w4 down
wait 300
expect punchbuf 4
shot 04_repeat.png
# a tone punch on top of a buffer one: both
key w8 down
wait 200
expect punch 272
shot 04b_repeat_crush.png
key w8 up
key w4 up
wait 200
key w5 down
wait 300
shot 05_stutter.png
key w5 up
wait 200
key w6 down
wait 300
shot 06_gate.png
key w6 up
wait 200
key w7 down
wait 400
shot 07_grain.png
key w7 up
wait 200
key w8 down
wait 300
shot 08_crush.png
key w8 up
wait 200
key w9 down
wait 900
shot 09_sweep.png
key w9 up
wait 200
key w10 down
wait 800
shot 10_wash.png
key w10 up
wait 200
key w11 down
wait 500
shot 11_wobble.png
# FX let go, the key still held: still punching
release FX
wait 200
expect punch 2048
key w11 up
wait 600
expect punch 0
# a black key with FX held still plays
press FX
key b0 down
wait 200
expect voices >3
key b0 up
release FX
# and without FX a white key is a note again
tapkey w2
wait 100
expect punch 0
midi 80 30 00
midi 80 37 00
midi 80 3c 00
